From: Helix OTA <dev@helixota.dev>
Date: Fri, 19 Jun 2026 09:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add FAT env CONFIG defines for A/B-virt emulator

CONFIG_ENV_FAT_INTERFACE, CONFIG_ENV_FAT_DEVICE_AND_PART, and
CONFIG_ENV_FAT_FILE are not Kconfig symbols in U-Boot 2024.01
for qemu_arm64 -- they are legacy #defines in the board header.

diff --git a/include/configs/qemu_arm64.h b/include/configs/qemu_arm64.h
index abcdef1..1234567 100644
--- a/include/configs/qemu_arm64.h
+++ b/include/configs/qemu_arm64.h
@@ -1,3 +1,10 @@
+/*
+ * FAT env support for A/B-virt emulator (PWU-AB-2)
+ */
+#define CONFIG_ENV_FAT_INTERFACE         "virtio"
+#define CONFIG_ENV_FAT_DEVICE_AND_PART   "0:1"
+#define CONFIG_ENV_FAT_FILE              "uboot.env"
+
 #ifndef __QEMU_ARM64_H
 #define __QEMU_ARM64_H
